              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "<p>New dog \nHe looks very like Susie!\n</p>\nPoor Shay had a bad injury last week, ended up getting his back right leg amputated on Tuesday, so he is just 2 days post surgery (picture from this angle as I dont want to put a fresh surgical wound area picture on Flickr!). Needs lots of TLC, I picked him up from the vets just this afternoon. We are fostering him but hope that we eventually adopt him. We are keeping him and Susie apart for now, she can be a bit of a bully and he needs peace! Short walks on lead for now, he is a bit down and quite anxious at times but he is a trusting wee fellow and I am hoping that we see him improve over coming days.",
